      "content": "\"Stopping the fight\" means accepting the current reality, not giving up on life itself, but giving up on the exhausting performance of trying to be something you're not. If your biology dictates a certain trajectory, then struggling against it is just adding unnecessary pain to an already predetermined path. Instead of fighting the current, you could just let yourself drift, finding a quiet peace in the surrender.",
